    }
  ],
  "_comment_2026_11_18": "New 85-item PKB template (Victor, 11/18/26): every 'Inspection - X' item is marked from the matching PASSED county inspection; a work item is marked only when a later inspection proves it was done (e.g. the formwork, rebars and pad by the foundation pre-pour). Not marked: the draws (2nd–6th Draw), windows/doors, roofing (shingles), stucco, drywall, painting, finishes, upgrades, connections, clean-up, landscaping, DEP letter.",
  "_comment_draws": "Draw items (Victor, 11/19/26): 'Nth Draw' is marked complete when the QuickBooks invoice for that stage exists (ops.qbo_draws_core billed_stages: the installment named in the invoice message; a 1st with only the address and a two-stage invoice are recognised)."
}
